<title>USA: Gray Communications CEO dies.</title>
<headline>Gray Communications CEO dies.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, Ga. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc said Tuesday its board of directors had named Mack Robinson as interim president and chief executive officer following the death of Ralph Gabbard, who had filled those posts.</p>
